@startuml
header lambda-serverless
footer Página %page% of %lastpage%\nmade with ♥ by Nequi
title Diagrama de Secuencia

actor Cliente
participant "AWS Lambda" as Handler
participant "Business/Service" as Business
database "DynamoDB\nNEQUI-PARAMETERS-QA" as Dynamo

Cliente -> Handler: Invocar Lambda
Handler -> Business: Procesar solicitud
Business -> Dynamo: Consultar datos
Dynamo --> Business: Resultado
Business --> Handler: Respuesta
Handler --> Cliente: Respuesta final
@enduml